  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alis exists - child protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alis is a project that aims to shed light on the experiences of young girls in Colombia who have been part of the foster care system due to violence, poverty, drug use, or homelessness. Our goal is to create a safe space where these girls can belong after leaving the system. We have established a club-house that offers emotional and professional support to help them start a new life, pursue education and employment opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
